I suppose it's a spoiler...but if you don't know, you're missing out!


	Nurses will give you hit points instead of hitting you if you are
wielding nothing and wearing no armor.  This comes in the form of healing
if you're hurt, and bonus max hp if you're in perfect condition.  After a
bit of this treatment they'll teleport away, but sometimes they stay on the
level, and you can use them again.
	One of the best wishes for the character who has it all is a
cursed scroll of genocide (or better yet, 3).  Choose nurses and watch
your hp skyrocket!  But make absolutely sure to remove all armor and
weapons before using the scroll!!!  Nothing worse then:

Snarf-B  Killed by a nurse.

